# Browser origins allowed to call the API. Anything else gets no CORS headers and is blocked.
# Server-to-server calls (no Origin header) are unaffected.
#
# This file holds non-secret deploy configuration and IS version-controlled on purpose: without it
# the deployed API refuses every browser origin, which looks like a total outage. Real secrets go in
# Secret Manager, never here.
#
# Add the panel's hosted origin here before deploying it anywhere (no trailing slash).
ADMIN_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000
